(7520123, 1201557, 19959, '<td valign="top">Beauty. The sky is the weak element. I''d revisit this scene and grab another shot with a stronger sky.. should do very well in the challenge. Excellent</td>', 'Beauty. The sky is the weak element. I''d revisit this scene and grab another shot with a stronger sky.. should do very well in the challenge. Excellent', '2017-06-24 16:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
