(7520136, 1201529, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good choice of title. A world map was what it immediately struck me as, before even noticing your title. Reminds me of the entry I did a couple of years ago that looked like the southeastern US coastline.</td>', 'A good choice of title. A world map was what it immediately struck me as, before even noticing your title. Reminds me of the entry I did a couple of years ago that looked like the southeastern US coastline.', '2017-06-24 21:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
