(7521050, 1201623, 37858, '<td valign="top">I am in total agreement with Paul.  I wish I hadn''t been too busy the past couple of weeks to participate at DPC, as I would have scored your image very high as well.  The fact that this is an untitled abstract makes it even more fun for me as I am left with my own imagination and your image. A title would have been in the way.</td>', 'I am in total agreement with Paul.  I wish I hadn''t been too busy the past couple of weeks to participate at DPC, as I would have scored your image very high as well.  The fact that this is an untitled abstract makes it even more fun for me as I am left with my own imagination and your image. A title would have been in the way.', '2017-07-01 04:12:51.000000', NULL, 0),
